{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"const createQueries: <T, TCombinedResult>(queriesOptions: Accessor<{\n  combine?: (result: T extends [] ? [] : T extends [Head] ? [GetResults<Head>] : T extends [Head, ...Tail[]] ? [...Tail[]] extends [] ? [] : [...(...)[]] extends [...] ? [..., ...] : ... extends ... ? ... : ... : { [K in string | number | symbol]: GetResults<(...)[(...)]> }) => TCombinedResult;\n  queries:   | readonly [T extends [] ? [] : T extends [Head] ? [GetOptions<Head>] : T extends [Head, ...Tail[]] ? [...Tail[]] extends [] ? [] : [...(...)[]] extends [...] ? [..., ...] : ... extends ... ? ... : ... : readonly unknown[] extends T ? T : T extends ...[] ? ...[] : ...[]]\n     | readonly [{ [K in string | number | symbol]: GetOptions<T[K]> }];\n}>, queryClient?: Accessor<QueryClient>) => TCombinedResult = useQueries;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/solid-query/src/index.ts#L86","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/solid-query/src/index.ts:86"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useQueries"},{"type":"text","value":" primitive can be used to fetch a variable number of queries."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"queries"},{"type":"text","value":" key accepts an array with query option objects mostly identical to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useQuery"},{"type":"text","value":" — see\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"placeholderData"},{"type":"text","value":" below for the one difference. A custom "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryClient"},{"type":"text","value":" is supplied once, as "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useQueries"},{"type":"text","value":"'\nown top-level second argument, rather than per query."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Having the same query key more than once in the array of query objects may cause some data to be shared\nbetween queries. To avoid this, consider de-duplicating the queries and map the results back to the desired\nstructure."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"combine"},{"type":"text","value":" option can be used to combine the results of the queries into a single value. The result will\nbe structurally shared to be as referentially stable as possible."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"placeholderData"},{"type":"text","value":" is supported here too, but unlike "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useQuery"},{"type":"text","value":", it doesn't receive information from\npreviously rendered queries, because the number of queries can differ between renders."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"t","children":[{"type":"text","value":"T"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"T"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"any"},{"type":"text","value":"[]"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tcombinedresult","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TCombinedResult"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TCombinedResult"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n| []\n| [\n| "},{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/QueryObserverRefetchErrorResult.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryObserverRefetchErrorResult"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Error"},{"type":"text","value":">\n| "},{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/QueryObserverSuccessResu